      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Considering your symptoms, to help alleviate the dizziness and eye strain, try sitting in a quiet, cool space and take slow, deep breaths. You can also try applying a warm compress to your eyes for a few minutes to ease the discomfort. Additionally, taking small sips of water or herbal tea, such as ginger or peppermint, can help stabilize your blood sugar and calm any inflammation. Avoid heavy screens for now and try to focus on a book or a different task to redirect your attention.",
