      "content": "i dont think i'm deficient in iron, i eat pretty well. i just really need something that works right now so i dont pass out in my meeting. is there any specific supplement or even an over the counter thing i can just take to get rid of this dizziness for good today? i'm just trying to avoid the hospital/doctor part if possible since it's such a hassle.",
